  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0: the models are refreshed from the v2 document of the stand. The subscription configuration carries the real cost the client is charged (priceCost), the subscription history carries the time of the action (time, seconds since 1970-01-01), and the raw tick-history description states the one-day window and one-million-tick limit. The operation surface is unchanged: 456 operations. Full notes: https://github.com/CPlugin/mywebapi.com-sdk-dotnet/blob/v0.6.0/CHANGELOG.md",
